 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Say hello",
   "texto": [
    "**Hallo** is for almost everyone. More formal: **Guten Morgen** (morning), **Guten Tag** (during the day) and **Guten Abend** (at night).",
    "To say goodbye: **Tschüss** (informal) or **Auf Wiedersehen** (formal)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "You and you.",
   "texto": [
    "**Du** is «You»: for friends, family and young people. **Sie** is «You» and is always written with capital. With unknown adults **Sie** is used.",
    "To say your name: **Ich heiße Anna** (my name is Anna) or **Ich bin Anna** (I am Anna).",
    "To ask: **Wie heißt du?** (you) or **Wie heißen Sie?** (you).",
    "When you meet someone: **Freut mich** (enchanted)."
   ]
  },
